{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30253","headline":"送庆上人归湖州因寄道儒座主 · 薛逢","name":"送庆上人归湖州因寄道儒座主","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上人今去白苹洲，霅水苕溪我旧游。\n夜雨暗江渔火出，夕阳沈浦鴈花收。\n闲听别鸟啼红树，醉看归僧櫂碧流。\n若见儒公凭寄语，数茎霜鬓已惊秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}